{"id":422,"title":"解答: 带乘法的嵌套循环复杂度","summary":"详细分析了解决带乘法的嵌套循环大O的表示方法。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6cc52f72-3258-4820-bf8e-f6f09edb0890","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dcdcd766-1a14-4fc7-8e80-a3b09aca0746","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n 可为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nvar = 1\nwhile var < n:\n    print(pie)\n    for j in range(var):\n        sum += 1\n    var *= 2\nprint(sum)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7aaa27b2-8c52-4dbc-b099-2f5771a20f75","text":"## 解释\n\n答案是$O(n)$。","text_html":"<h2>解释</h2>\n<p>答案是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f228bcab-8600-4b34-b0c9-667ff45ead7e","text":"### 复杂度分析\n\n这里的外循环运行 $log(n)$ 次。 在外循环的第一次迭代中，内循环的主体运行一次。 在第二次迭代中，它运行两次，以此类推。 内循环体的执行次数以 2 的幂增加。因此，如果 $k$ 是外循环的迭代次数，则内循环体总共运行 $1+2+4+8 +\\cdots+2^k$ 次。 这个 [几何系列](https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/1_%2B_2_%2B_4_%2B_8_%2B_%E2%80%A6) 总和为 $2^{k+1}-1$。 内循环条件要求内循环最后一次运行，最多运行$n$次。 这需要 $2^k < n$，即 $k < log_2n$，或 $k = \\lfloor log_2n \\rfloor$。 这意味着几何数总和为 $2^{\\lfloor log_2n \\rfloor+1} -1$ 或 $2^{\\lceil log_2n \\rceil} -1$。 换句话说，总和 **至少**为 $n-1$。 但是对于 Big O，我们需要这个值的上限。\n\n当改变$n$的值时，内循环迭代次数如下:\n\n| *n*   | **内循迭代次数**|\n|----------|-----------|:--------------|\n| 1   | 0     |\n| 2   | 1     |\n| 3   | 3     |\n| 4   | 3     |\n| 5   | 7     |\n| 6   | 7     |\n| 7   | 7     |\n| 8   | 7     |\n| 9   | 15     |\n| 10   | 15     |\n| 11   | 15     |\n| 12   | 15     |\n| 13   | 15     |\n| 14   | 15    |\n| 15   | 15     |\n| 16  | 15    |\n| 17   | 31    |\n\n正如你对 $\\lceil n \\rceil$ 指数所期望的那样，内循环的迭代次数以 2 的整数幂变化。 在 $n = 4$ 时，迭代次数是 $3$，在 $n = 8$ 时，它是 $7$ 等等。所以，对于 n 的值是 $2$ 的整数次幂，迭代次数是 $n - 1美元。 这符合我们对迭代次数的下限。 上界在 $n = 2^i + 1$ 上很明显，其中 $i = 1, 2, 3, 4, ...$，即 $n = 3, 5, 9, 17, ...$ 您会注意到，在这些 $n$ 值下，内循环的迭代次数比下一个更高的 2 的整数幂少 1，即 $2(n - 1) - 1 = 2n - 3$。\n\n因此，内部循环体的迭代次数至少为 $n - 1$，最多为 $2n - 3$。\n\n另外，外层for循环语句占 $4\\lceil log_2 n \\rceil$，而内部循环的总贡献至少为 $8n - 12$。 因此，总运行时间至少为 $4\\lceil log_2 n \\rceil + 8n - 12$。 删除常量和低阶项给我们 $n$。\n\n因此，大O时间复杂度是 **$O(n)$**","text_html":"<h3>复杂度分析</h3>\n<p>这里的外循环运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 次。 在外循环的第一次迭代中，内循环的主体运行一次。 在第二次迭代中，它运行两次，以此类推。 内循环体的执行次数以 2 的幂增加。因此，如果 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span></span> 是外循环的迭代次数，则内循环体总共运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+2+4+8 +\\cdots+2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.849108em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.932438em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">8</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span> 次。 这个 <a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/1_%2B_2_%2B_4_%2B_8_%2B_%E2%80%A6\">几何系列</a> 总和为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{k+1}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.849108em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.932438em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>。 内循环条件要求内循环最后一次运行，最多运行<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>次。 这需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k &lt; n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.849108em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.888208em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &lt; log_2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>，或 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>⌊</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\lfloor log_2n \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span>。 这意味着几何数总和为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>⌋</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\lfloor log_2n \\rfloor+1} -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8879999999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.9713299999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-scriptstyle scriptscriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>⌈</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>⌉</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{\\lceil log_2n \\rceil} -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8879999999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.9713299999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.07142857142857144em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-scriptstyle scriptscriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>。 换句话说，总和 <strong>至少</strong>为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>。 但是对于 Big O，我们需要这个值的上限。</p>\n<p>当改变<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>的值时，内循环迭代次数如下:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><em>n</em></th>\n<th><strong>内循迭代次数</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>31</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>正如你对 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil n \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span> 指数所期望的那样，内循环的迭代次数以 2 的整数幂变化。 在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span></span></span></span> 时，迭代次数是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">8</span></span></span></span> 时，它是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span></span></span></span> 等等。所以，对于 n 的值是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span> 的整数次幂，迭代次数是 $n - 1美元。 这符合我们对迭代次数的下限。 上界在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 2^i + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.824664em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.907994em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span> 上很明显，其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = 1, 2, 3, 4, ...</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.65952em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.85396em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 3, 5, 9, 17, ...</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8388800000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span></span></span></span> 您会注意到，在这些 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span> 值下，内循环的迭代次数比下一个更高的 2 的整数幂少 1，即 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(n - 1) - 1 = 2n - 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>因此，内部循环体的迭代次数至少为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>，最多为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n - 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>另外，外层for循环语句占 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⌈</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\lceil log_2 n \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span>，而内部循环的总贡献至少为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8n - 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>。 因此，总运行时间至少为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⌈</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo>⌉</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\lceil log_2 n \\rceil + 8n - 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>。 删除常量和低阶项给我们 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>因此，大O时间复杂度是 <strong><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/422"}
